@startuml
title Create Order - sequence
actor Client
participant Gateway
participant OrderService
participant MongoDB
participant RabbitMQ
participant InventoryService

Client -> Gateway: POST /orders
Gateway -> OrderService: HTTP POST /orders
OrderService -> MongoDB: insert order document
OrderService -> RabbitMQ: publish OrderCreated event
RabbitMQ -> InventoryService: deliver OrderCreated
InventoryService -> MongoDB: reserve items / update stock
InventoryService -> RabbitMQ: publish InventoryUpdated (optional)
Gateway --> Client: 201 Created (order id)
@enduml